{"seq":3,"slug":"monitoring-capacity","title":"监控与容量规划","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/database-sharding-partitioning/operations/monitoring-capacity","wordCount":1796,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"监控与容量规划\">监控与容量规划</h1><p>分片系统出事，往往不是「突然」出事。某个分片的磁盘水位用了半年悄悄爬到 92%，复制延迟从几毫秒慢慢漂到几秒，某个 key 的访问占比一点点逼近临界——所有征兆都写在数据里，只是没人把它们当成一条要预测的曲线来看。监控与容量规划要做的，就是在分片冒烟之前看见趋势，把扩容和重分片从「半夜被叫醒的救火」变成「计划内的例行维护」。这一篇讲分片系统该监控什么、以及如何把容量当成可预测的对象来规划。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>分片系统的可观测性有一个区别于单机的根本原则：要看分布，不能只看均值。集群的平均 CPU 利用率 40% 可能掩盖着一个 95% 的分片，平均健康从来不等于每个分片都健康。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[采集每分片指标] --&gt; B[存储水位]&#10;    A --&gt; C[负载分布 QPS]&#10;    A --&gt; D[复制延迟]&#10;    A --&gt; E[慢查询]&#10;    B --&gt; F[看分布尾部&lt;br/&gt;非均值]&#10;    C --&gt; F&#10;    F --&gt; G{趋势预测}&#10;    G --&gt;|逼近阈值| H[计划扩容/重分片]&#10;    G --&gt;|出现倾斜| I[触发倾斜缓解]&#10;    G --&gt;|平稳| J[继续观测]&#10;    H --&gt; K[提前留迁移窗口]\">flowchart TD\n    A[采集每分片指标] --&gt; B[存储水位]\n    A --&gt; C[负载分布 QPS]\n    A --&gt; D[复制延迟]\n    A --&gt; E[慢查询]\n    B --&gt; F[看分布尾部&lt;br/&gt;非均值]\n    C --&gt; F\n    F --&gt; G{趋势预测}\n    G --&gt;|逼近阈值| H[计划扩容/重分片]\n    G --&gt;|出现倾斜| I[触发倾斜缓解]\n    G --&gt;|平稳| J[继续观测]\n    H --&gt; K[提前留迁移窗口]</pre><p>下表列出分片系统的核心监控维度及其意义：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>监控维度</th>\n<th>关键指标</th>\n<th>告警含义</th>\n<th>关联动作</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>存储容量</td>\n<td>各分片磁盘使用率</td>\n<td>逼近上限需扩容</td>\n<td>重分片/加分片</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>负载分布</td>\n<td>各分片 QPS/CPU 的离散度</td>\n<td>倾斜加剧</td>\n<td>倾斜缓解</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>复制延迟</td>\n<td>主从延迟秒数</td>\n<td>读副本数据陈旧</td>\n<td>排查/限流</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>热键</td>\n<td>top-k key 访问占比</td>\n<td>单键过热</td>\n<td>加盐/缓存</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>跨分片查询</td>\n<td>扇出查询比例与延迟</td>\n<td>路由效率下降</td>\n<td>优化键/建 GSI</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"看分布而非均值\">看分布而非均值</h2><p>单机时代盯平均利用率没问题，因为只有一台机器；分片系统里，平均值是最危险的指标。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 个分片，只要一个被打爆，用户体验就崩了，而它的痛苦会被其余 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N-1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 个空闲分片在平均值里稀释得无影无踪。设各分片负载为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>load</mtext><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mtext>load</mtext><mi>N</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{load}_1, \\dots, \\text{load}_N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">load</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">load</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，真正该盯的是它们的最大值与离散程度，而非算术平均：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>关注</mtext><mtext>  </mtext><mo>→</mo><mtext>  </mtext><munder><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi>i</mi></munder><msub><mtext>load</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mfrac><mrow><munder><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi>i</mi></munder><msub><mtext>load</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>N</mi></mfrac><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><msub><mtext>load</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{关注} \\;\\to\\; \\max_i \\text{load}_i, \\quad \\frac{\\max_i \\text{load}_i}{\\frac{1}{N}\\sum_i \\text{load}_i}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">关注</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4515em;vertical-align:-1.0801em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop\">max</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7277em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">load</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.2649em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">load</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">load</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.0801em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>后一个比值就是 <a href=\"../challenges/hotspots-skew\">热点与数据倾斜</a> 里反复用到的倾斜度。监控面板的第一公民应当是「最热分片」和「分片负载离散度」，而不是集群均值。同理还要监控热键的 top-k 访问占比——单个 key 的过热是均值永远看不见的，必须专门采样。把可观测性建立在「分布」之上，是分片运维区别于单机运维的根本。</p>\n<h2 id=\"容量规划-把水位当成可预测的曲线\">容量规划：把水位当成可预测的曲线</h2><p>容量规划的成熟标志，是把每个分片的容量水位当成一条要被外推预测的时间序列，而不是一个等着被突破的阈值。如果某分片磁盘以每周 1.5% 的速度增长、当前 80%，那么大约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>100</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>80</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1.5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mtext>周</mtext></mrow></mfrac><mo>≈</mo><mn>13</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{100\\% - 80\\%}{1.5\\%/\\text{周}} \\approx 13</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.439em;vertical-align:-0.52em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.919em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1.5%/</span><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">周</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">100%</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">80%</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.52em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">13</span></span></span></span></span> 周后触顶——这条简单的线性外推就足以让你在三个月前就把扩容排进计划。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>满</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>当前</mtext></msub></mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mtext>增长</mtext></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{\\text{满}} = \\frac{C_{\\max} - C_{\\text{当前}}}{r_{\\text{增长}}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">满</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1963em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">增长</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">当前</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这一点至关重要，因为 <a href=\"../challenges/rebalancing-resharding\">再平衡与重分片</a> 不是瞬时操作——在线迁移要限速以免饿死在线流量，几 TB 数据可能要搬好几天。如果等到告警响起（比如 95%）才动手，留给迁移的窗口就太紧了，要么被迫提速冒着影响线上的风险、要么真的撑满。提前按趋势预测、在水位逼近阈值前若干周从容启动，是把重分片做成「计划内例行维护」的前提。增长率本身也要监控——业务突发（如大促、病毒式传播）会让线性外推失效，因此还需对增长率的拐点告警。</p>\n<h2 id=\"该监控的其他关键信号\">该监控的其他关键信号</h2><p>除了容量与负载分布，还有几类信号是分片系统特有的健康指标。复制延迟衡量读副本落后主库多少——延迟一旦增大，读副本上的查询就在读陈旧数据，会让缓解读热点的副本扇出（见 <a href=\"../challenges/hotspots-skew\">热点与数据倾斜</a>）变得不可靠。跨分片查询比例反映路由效率：如果本应单分片命中的查询里扇出查询占比悄悄升高，往往说明访问模式变了、当初的分区键不再贴合主路径，是该考虑建 <a href=\"global-secondary-indexes\">全局二级索引</a> 或调整设计的信号。</p>\n<p>慢查询要按分片归因——同一条 SQL 在多数分片上很快、却在某个分片上慢，通常指向那个分片的数据倾斜或资源争用。部分失败率也值得专门监控：<a href=\"shard-routing\">分片路由与中间件</a> 里讲过散布查询的成功率随分片数衰减为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>p</mi><mi>N</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p^N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0358em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8413em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，持续偏高的部分失败率是路由层或某些分片不稳定的早期信号。这些指标的共同来源，往往是路由层和拓扑服务持续吐出的状态数据——把它们接入统一的指标系统，分片集群才真正可观测。</p>\n<h2 id=\"从救火到例行-闭环的最后一环\">从救火到例行：闭环的最后一环</h2><p>监控与容量规划是这个 hub 的收尾，因为它把前三章的所有设计串成了一个能长期运转的闭环。选键选得好不好，要靠监控分布来验证；分片策略扛不扛得住，要靠负载离散度来检验；倾斜和重分片何时该出手，要靠容量趋势来决定。没有这层可观测性，再优雅的分片设计也是盲飞——你不知道哪个分片快满了、哪个 key 在过热、哪次重分片该启动。</p>\n<p>成熟的分片运维追求的状态是「无意外」：扩容是按预测排好的计划，重分片是演练过的标准流程，倾斜在变成事故前就被缓解。这一切的前提，是把容量当成一条被持续观测、外推、提前响应的曲线，而非一个等着触发的告警阈值。当你能在每个分片冒烟之前就看见它的趋势并从容应对时，这套分片系统才算真正可运维、可长期演进——这正是整个 hub 想带你抵达的终点。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>分片监控的根本原则是看分布而非均值：集群平均健康不等于每个分片健康，要盯最热分片与离散度。</li>\n<li>倾斜度（最热分片/均值）与热键 top-k 占比是均值看不见的关键信号，须专门采样。</li>\n<li>容量规划要把水位当可外推的时间序列，按增长率预测触顶时间，提前若干周启动扩容。</li>\n<li>提前规划是因为在线重分片需限速、耗时数天，等告警才动手会让迁移窗口过紧。</li>\n<li>还需监控复制延迟、跨分片查询比例、按分片归因的慢查询、散布查询部分失败率。</li>\n<li>监控与容量规划是闭环最后一环，把前三章的选键、策略、倾斜与重分片串成可长期演进的「无意外」运维。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"监控与容量规划","id":"监控与容量规划"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"看分布而非均值","id":"看分布而非均值"},{"level":2,"text":"容量规划：把水位当成可预测的曲线","id":"容量规划-把水位当成可预测的曲线"},{"level":2,"text":"该监控的其他关键信号","id":"该监控的其他关键信号"},{"level":2,"text":"从救火到例行：闭环的最后一环","id":"从救火到例行-闭环的最后一环"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"全局二级索引","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/database-sharding-partitioning/operations/global-secondary-indexes"},"next":null}